# Exact downstream requests in order (file edits between steps 1/3 and 4/6)

### step 1: external host file edit — file-edit add oracle-hot-key-2 (external)
(config.yaml api-keys list edited in place; no API call; sleep 2s for the watcher)

### step 2: 30 api-keys echo
GET /v0/management/api-keys HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




### step 3: 30 /v1/models with NEW key
