Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-hot-key-2




### step 4: external host file edit — file-edit revert (external)
(config.yaml api-keys list edited in place; no API call; sleep 2s for the watcher)

### step 5: 30 api-keys echo reverted
GET /v0/management/api-keys HTTP/1.1
